            <title>2.23.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 01:43:15 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>102</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.23.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

- The sidebar's session history now holds 50 sessions you can actually open, instead of 50 files scanned. Sub-agents, `/security-review` runs and title generation each write a transcript that the list filters out — but those were counted against the limit before being dropped, so the more sub-agents you ran, the fewer sessions the sidebar showed. On a machine with 1,555 sessions on disk the newest 50 files held 41 automated ones and the list came back with 9 rows.
]]></description>
